1
00:00:03,933 --> 00:00:07,500
Soft like a feather, warm like the sun,

2
00:00:08,133 --> 00:00:12,700
Gentle love for everyone.

3
00:00:15,966 --> 00:00:19,800
Here comes a puppy, wagging his tail.

4
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,766
His fur is soft as a little sail.

5
00:00:23,933 --> 00:00:27,766
I don't squeeze, and I don't grab.

6
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:31,500
Gentle strokes make puppies glad.

7
00:00:34,066 --> 00:00:37,800
Gentle hands, soft and sweet,

8
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:41,600
Pat, pat, pat to a quiet beat.

9
00:00:41,933 --> 00:00:45,800
No rough pushing, no rough cries,

10
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:51,066
Only kindness in our eyes.

11
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:01,400
When baby sister is fast asleep,

12
00:01:01,666 --> 00:01:05,500
I walk as quiet as little sheep.

13
00:01:05,933 --> 00:01:09,533
Gentle words and gentle hug,

14
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:13,466
Warm as a cuddle in a rug.

15
00:01:15,900 --> 00:01:19,600
Gentle hands, soft and sweet,

16
00:01:19,766 --> 00:01:23,466
Pat, pat, pat to a quiet beat.

17
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:27,600
No rough pushing, no rough cries,

18
00:01:27,966 --> 00:01:33,533
Only kindness in our eyes.

19
00:01:39,566 --> 00:01:43,566
Soft and gentle, sweet and kind,

20
00:01:43,766 --> 00:01:50,333
Peace and gentleness we find.

